OL,3,AMan admits sexually assaulting woman
OL,4,Adrugged by husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to sexually
OL,7,Fassaulting a woman who had been drugged
OL,8,Fand raped by her husband without her
OL,9,Fknowledge for more than 20 years.
OL,11,FThe husband, who cannot be named to
OL,12,Fprotect his wife's legal right to
OL,13,Fanonymity, is accused of inviting 13
OL,14,Fother men to abuse her at their family
OL,15,Fhome in the Stockport area of Greater
OL,16,FManchester.
OL,18,FSean Peers, 38, was due to stand trial
OL,19,Fat Manchester Minshull Street Crown
OL,20,FCourt earlier but admitted one count of
OL,21,Fassault by penetration on 15 September
OL,22,F2024.
